Description: DevTools frontend: support embedders without undocking
 Adds a noUndock URL parameter which removes the "Undock into
 separate window" dock side from the main menu and from the dock side
 toggling cycle (Ctrl+Shift+D).
Author: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: not-needed

